      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects backup-system health: last snapshot age and count for restic and borg repositories (from a config file), and active backup-related systemd timers (restic/borg/b2/rclone/duplicity/timeshift units). Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype backup:status) and backup.* metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype backup:metrics) - configured flag, snapshot counts, snapshot age in hours, active timer count - with dashboards.",
